---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StaffProfile from '../components/StaffProfile.astro';
import { secretariat } from '../data/staff';
---

<Layout title="About — DCBMUN">
	<div class="w-full h-30 bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-headings font-bold text-light-500">About</h1>
	</div>
	<div class="w-full px-2 md:px-0 md:w-3/5 mx-auto my-10 font-body">
		<p class="text-xl text-dark-500 text-center">
			Dr. Charles Best Model United Nations (DCBMUN) is a student-run, not-for-profit
			Model United Nations conference designed to introduce high school students to a
			world of diplomacy, debate, and collaboration. DCBMUN aims to create an engaging
			environment where both experienced delegates and newcomers can develop confidence,
			enhance speaking skills, and explore global issues through problem-solving.
		</p>
		<br />
		<p class="text-xl text-dark-500 text-center">
			Founded on the belief that opportunities for learning and leadership should be
			accessible to everyone, DCBMUN emphasizes inclusion, inquisitiveness, and innovation.
			Whether delegates are attending their first conference or looking to strengthen their
			diplomatic abilities, DCBMUN offers a supportive environment where every delegate is
			encouraged to participate, collaborate, and grow with confidence.
		</p>
		<br />
		<p class="text-xl text-dark-500 text-center">
			DCBMUN believes that one's greatest means of communication comes from the confidence
			one has to learn from themselves and others. In order to learn from yourself, DCBMUN
			believes one must be able to believe in one's self; this is why DCBMUN has chosen
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="w-11/12 md:w-1/2 mx-auto bg-gold-500 h-auto rounded-xl text-2xl text-center p-5 text-light-500 font-bold font-headings">
		“Always believe in yourself. Do this and no matter where you are, you will have nothing to fear" <span class="text-nowrap">- Hayao Miyazaki</span>
	</div>
	<div class="w-full px-2 md:px-0 md:w-3/5 mx-auto my-10 font-body">
		<p class="text-xl text-dark-500 text-center">
			to represent our first iteration. From believing in yourself you can truly learn from yourself, then you will have nothing to fear.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="w-full h-30 bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-headings font-bold text-light-500">Secretariat</h1>
	</div>
	<div class="w-full mx-auto my-10 font-body">
		{secretariat.map(person => (
			<StaffProfile
				headshot_src={person.headshot_src}
				name={person.name}
				title={person.title}
				email={person.email}
				biography={person.biography}
			/>
		))}
	</div>
	<!--<div class="w-full h-30 bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center">-->
	<!--	<h1 class="text-4xl font-headings font-bold text-light-500">Staff</h1>-->
	<!--</div>-->
	<!--<div class="w-1/2 mx-auto my-10 font-body">-->
	<!--	<p class="text-xl text-dark-500 text-center">-->
	<!--		Coming soon.-->
	<!--	</p>-->
	<!--</div>-->
</Layout>
